{"manifest_version": "2.0", "session_id": "sess_4", "course_id": "course_161c4b9518", "title": "deeper", "learning_goal": "", "generation_mode": "llm", "total_duration_ms": 45432, "actions": [{"type": "board", "step_id": 2, "board_uid": 1, "title": "换个讲法：快递分拣口", "board_content": "- 5 个出口，3 个入口\n- weight 一行 = 一个出口\n- 行数 = 出口数 = 5\n- 列数 = 入口数 = 3\n- 所以 weight 是 5 × 3", "layout": "newcol", "reveal_gate_step": 1, "page_id": "page-1"}, {"type": "speak", "step_id": 1, "spoken_text": "换个日常例子。把线性层想成快递分拣：5 个出口，每个出口要读 3 个入口的包裹。PyTorch 的 weight 就像一张分拣表，一行对应一个出口，所以有 5 行；每行记录它从 3 个入口各拿多少，所以有 3 列。看这一行，行数就是出口数。"}, {"type": "circle", "step_id": 3, "target_board_uid": 1, "snippet": "weight 一行 = 一个出口", "color": null, "during_step": 1, "at_ms": 8065}, {"type": "tts_segment", "step_id": 1, "audio_url": null, "duration_ms": 23044, "tts_cjk": 79, "tts_latin": 18, "speed": 1.0, "skipped": false, "marks": [[0, 0], [1, 268], [2, 537], [3, 806], [4, 1075], [5, 1344], [6, 1612], [7, 1828], [8, 2062], [9, 2296], [10, 2530], [11, 2764], [12, 2999], [13, 3233], [14, 3467], [15, 3701], [16, 3936], [17, 4170], [18, 4357], [19, 4463], [20, 4498], [21, 4732], [22, 4966], [23, 5200], [24, 5388], [25, 5622], [26, 5856], [27, 6090], [28, 6325], [29, 6559], [30, 6793], [31, 6828], [32, 6934], [33, 6969], [34, 7203], [35, 7437], [36, 7671], [37, 7906], [38, 8140], [39, 8374], [40, 8562], [41, 8660], [42, 8758], [43, 8856], [44, 8955], [45, 9053], [46, 9151], [47, 9250], [48, 9282], [49, 9501], [50, 9534], [51, 9632], [52, 9730], [53, 9829], [54, 9927], [55, 10025], [56, 10124], [57, 10156], [58, 10375], [59, 10593], [60, 10812], [61, 11030], [62, 11249], [63, 11467], [64, 11686], [65, 11860], [66, 12079], [67, 12297], [68, 12516], [69, 12734], [70, 12953], [71, 13171], [72, 13390], [73, 13608], [74, 13783], [75, 14001], [76, 14220], [77, 14438], [78, 14471], [79, 14569], [80, 14602], [81, 14821], [82, 14996], [83, 15236], [84, 15476], [85, 15716], [86, 15956], [87, 16197], [88, 16437], [89, 16473], [90, 